<title>USA: U.S. Can Corp to issue notes.</title>
<headline>U.S. Can Corp to issue notes.</headline>
<dateline>OAK BROOK, Ill. 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Can Corp said Thursday it plans to offer $225 million in senior subordinated notes due 2006.</p>
<p>Proceeds will be used to redeem the entire $100 million principal amount outstanding of 13-1/2 percent senior subordinated notes, callable January 15.</p>
<p>The proceed will also be used to repay acquisition debt and for other corporate purposes, the company said.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
